• Participate in the full application and data reporting development lifecycle-including planning, design, development, testing, migration, and production support.

• Build, maintain, and integrate robust RESTful APIs and Web Services.

• Write clean, readable, maintainable, and well-tested code (unit and integration tests).

&nbsp;

