Technical Skills&nbsp;

• PHP Expertise : 6+ years of hands-on experience in full-stack PHP web development and web application architecture.

• Frameworks: Proficiency with modern PHP MVC frameworks (CodeIgniter, or similar).

• Database &amp; SQL: Strong experience with relational database design, query optimization, and SQL development (particularly MySQL).

• Front-End Development: Proficient in HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+), and modern front-end libraries/frameworks (jQuery/Bootstrap).

• API Integration: Proven expertise building and consuming third-party RESTful APIs and Web Services.

• Testing &amp; Quality Assurance: Demonstrated experience writing unit and integration tests to ensure reliable code delivery.

Communication &amp; Task Execution Skills&nbsp;

• Active Listening &amp; Task Comprehension

• Verbal &amp; Written Communication&nbsp;

• Self-Direction &amp; Ownership&nbsp;

Nice to Have Skills

• Background or experience in advertising technology, media planning, or ad-trafficking systems.

• Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and CI/CD pipelines.

